# Switch the FCB-EV9520L's IR cut filter.
#
#   rgb      daylight colour, IR cut filter in        (also: day, color)
#   ir       filter out, infrared-sensitive mono      (also: night, mono)
#   rgb+ir   filter out, colour retained              (also: night_color)
#   auto     the camera switches on scene brightness
#
# One sensor behind a removable filter, not a thermal camera: the mode
# changes the one video stream from that moment on.
string mode
---
bool success
string message
# The mode now in effect: rgb, ir, rgb+ir or auto.
string mode
